# SHA-256 digests of the bridge binaries published for the version in
# manifest.json. bridge.sh refuses to execute a download that does not match
# the line for its architecture, so the executable that actually runs is bound
# to this commit and not to whatever a mutable release asset happens to hold.
#
# These are produced by the release workflow, not by a local build: see
# "Releasing" in README.md. Regenerate them for every version bump.
